            <Placemark id="970">
                <name>2.00in hail 1 NE Linden (10/22 2300Z) - Confirmed: spotter/public report</name>
                <description>Basis: Confirmed: spotter/public report
Two photos of hail sent to NWS Flagstaff. One showed quarter size hail with a quarter for a comparison. Second showed larger hail estimated to be around 2 inches. (FGZ)
SPC filtered hail 261022 (added late: 2.00" 1 NE Linden 2300Z) = IEM/NWS LSR HAIL 2.00 (qualifier M, Trained Spotter, NWS Flagstaff, product 202610232132-KFGZ issued 10/23 21:32Z). Same storm: 1.25" M trained spotter Linden 23:24Z. DISCREPANCY: LSR codes it "measured" but the remark says "estimated to be around 2 inches" from a photo - treated as spotter/public (rank 2), not measured. MRMS MESH (24h ending 10/23 12Z) at the report: 1.80". HailTrace public 10/22 page did not list it at the 10/23 run (late report).</description>
                <Point id="969">
                    <coordinates>-110.15,34.29,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
            </Placemark>
